From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:05:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(compose): add explicit native dispatch capture on
 Android

Add Modifier.nativeDispatchCapture() and a PointerInputModifierNode
captureNativeDispatch() hook. When a touch-down hits such a node, the
Compose root sets the nativeDispatchCapture prop and the Android KRView
keeps the whole gesture from reaching native child views underneath
(overlays, barriers). Ordinary pointer modifiers are unaffected.

Fork-Patch: compose-android-native-dispatch-capture
Origin: 95275204
Upstream-Status: pending
Signed-off-by: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
